text='# Chapter and scene map — White Fang\n\nWorking review document: contains full-story spoilers. All five parts and 25 complete source chapters were read. Exact witness SHA-256: `'+cov['sourceSha256']+'`. Locators are electronic lines, never print pages.\n\nThe connected Russian draft was completed before the English draft; segmentation then retained 86 whole narrative paragraphs, one per reading unit. Final count after root repair is 36 / 51 / 89 including cover/final (and one Deep warning). Deep has 8,173 RU narrative words, about45 minutes at180wpm. The length follows the preserved events and relationships below, not a screen or word quota. It gives repeated actions and reactions room—Henry’s siege, the first outing, the sale, Cherokee, trust, the southern household and recovery—while compressing repetitive exposition and incidental speech. It is an original condensation, not the unabridged novel.\n\nEssential’s 34 narrative units follow pursuit, cubhood, camp, separation, chosen return, sled-work, Fort Yukon, sale and fighting to Cherokee’s appearance. Core’s 49 add the full first outing, snare/porcupine sequences, camp retaliation and later famine, with the same unresolved stopping point. Both advertise that limit honestly and withhold the fight’s result. Deep preserves every selected scene in order and continues through all later decisive events to the puppies. Neither the cover nor shared final states those outcomes.\n\n## Coverage and real omissions\n\n| Source chapter | Retained experience | Compression / omission |\n|---|---|---|\n'
for a,b,c in notes:text+=f'| {a} | {b} | {c} |\n'
text+='\n## Paragraph-to-screen map\n\nEach row is exactly one matching RU/EN prose paragraph. Source ranges are chapter-wide unless a bridge explicitly crosses divisions.\n\n| Screen ID | Level | RU / EN scene | Primary range | Draft chapter : paragraph |\n|---|---:|---|---|---|\n'
for r in s:text+=f"| `{r['id']}` | {r['level']} | {r['title']['ru']} / {r['title']['en']} | {r['locator']} | {r['draftChapter']} : {r['draftParagraph']} |\n"
text+='\nCover, deep-warning and final are framing, not narrative. No management/coaching/application ending. Complete late-resolution check: Hall’s last conviction is wrongful; the judge is ignorant of fabrication; Alice admits White Fang; the attack leaves both bodies downstairs; White Fang survives prolonged care and dreams; Collie’s six puppies climb over him and he drowses in sunshine. Root personal reading and exact-hash acceptance are recorded separately in root-review; implementation QA alone is not acceptance.\n'
